1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,840
Stop telling ChatGPT you run a diner. 40 times!

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,240
It keeps forgetting.

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,340
So tell it once. In settings.

4
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,340
Once where.

5
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:10,690
Custom instructions! Who you are, who it's for, how long.

6
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:12,890
"Tired man. Pancakes. Short answers."

7
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:15,620
Perfect. It reads that before every new chat.

8
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:16,620
Every chat.

9
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,030
Every. Single. Chat. Like a loyal waffle.

10
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,830
We don't sell waffles.

11
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:24,510
New menu item: the Settings Stack. Comment SETUP for the template.

12
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:28,710
So I never tell it I run a diner again.

